---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Bend Oregon SEO Consultant | SEO Services in Bend, OR"
  description="SEO consulting and organic search strategy for Bend, Oregon businesses that want better rankings, more visibility, stronger local search performance, and more qualified leads."
>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">Bend Oregon SEO Services</p>

          <h1>SEO help for Bend businesses that want to get found.</h1>

          <p class="hero-text">
            I help Bend businesses improve Google visibility, local search performance,
            website structure, content strategy, and search-driven leads.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/contact/" class="primary-btn">Contact Me About Bend SEO</a>
            <a href="/services/ai-search" class="secondary-btn">AI Search Strategy</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="visibility-card">
          <p class="card-label">Bend SEO Visibility</p>

          <div class="dashboard-list">
            <div class="dashboard-row">
              <span>Google Search</span>
              <span class="status active">Priority</span>
            </div>

            <div class="dashboard-row">
              <span>Google Maps</span>
              <span class="status active">Local</span>
            </div>

            <div class="dashboard-row">
              <span>Service Pages</span>
              <span class="status active">Core</span>
            </div>

            <div class="dashboard-row">
              <span>Technical SEO</span>
              <span class="status active">Foundation</span>
            </div>

            <div class="dashboard-row">
              <span>Content Strategy</span>
              <span class="status warning">Opportunity</span>
            </div>

            <div class="dashboard-row">
              <span>AI Search</span>
              <span class="status warning">Growing</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="dashboard-summary">
            <div>
              <strong>Bend</strong>
              <span>Local Focus</span>
            </div>

            <div>
              <strong>SEO + AI</strong>
              <span>Search Strategy</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro">
      <div class="container intro-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Local search strategy</p>
          <h2>People are searching before they call, book, visit, or buy.</h2>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p>
            Bend is competitive. Whether you run a local service business, outdoor brand,
            healthcare practice, real estate business, restaurant, tourism company, or
            professional service firm, your website needs to clearly show what you offer.
          </p>

          <p>
            I help businesses build stronger SEO foundations, improve local visibility,
            and turn search traffic into leads, bookings, and revenue.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="scorecard">
      <div class="container scorecard-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">SEO visibility check</p>
          <h2>How visible is your Bend business in search?</h2>
          <p>
            I can review how your business shows up across Google, local map results,
            your website pages, technical SEO, content, and AI search opportunities.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="primary-btn">Request a Bend SEO Review</a>
        </div>

        <div class="scorecard-panel">
          <div class="score-row">
            <span>Google Search</span>
            <strong>Organic visibility</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="score-row">
            <span>Google Maps</span>
            <strong>Local discovery</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="score-row">
            <span>Google Business Profile</span>
            <strong>Local trust</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="score-row">
            <span>Website Pages</span>
            <strong>Service clarity</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="score-row">
            <span>Technical SEO</span>
            <strong>Crawlability</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="score-row">
            <span>Content Strategy</span>
            <strong>Search intent coverage</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="section-label">What I help with</p>
          <h2>Practical SEO support for Bend, Oregon businesses.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="service-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-number">01</span>
            <h3>Local SEO Strategy</h3>
            <p>
              Improve how your business appears for Bend-area searches, map results,
              service terms, and high-intent local keywords.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-number">02</span>
            <h3>Website SEO</h3>
            <p>
              Strengthen title tags, page structure, internal links, headings,
              crawlability, and the content signals search engines use to understand your site.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-number">03</span>
            <h3>Content Planning</h3>
            <p>
              Build service pages, location pages, guides, and supporting content
              that bring in people looking for exactly what you offer.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <span class="card-number">04</span>
            <h3>Reporting & Strategy</h3>
            <p>
              Use organic traffic, leads, rankings, and search visibility data to decide
              what to fix, improve, and build next.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="search-everywhere">
      <div class="container search-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label light">Beyond rankings</p>
          <h2>Good SEO should support real business goals.</h2>
          <p>
            Rankings matter, but they are not the whole point. The real goal is getting
            in front of the right people and helping them take the next step.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="channel-grid">
          <div>Local Searches</div>
          <div>Map Results</div>
          <div>Service Pages</div>
          <div>Reviews</div>
          <div>Content Hubs</div>
          <div>AI Search</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="section-label">Bend-based SEO support</p>
          <h2>Local search strategy with a Central Oregon perspective.</h2>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p>
            I live in Central Oregon and understand how people search for local businesses here.
            That helps when building pages around Bend neighborhoods, nearby towns, seasonal demand,
            tourism, outdoor activities, and local service searches.
          </p>

          <p>
            My work focuses on making your website clearer, more useful, and easier to find.
            That can include local SEO, technical fixes, content planning, keyword research,
            internal linking, reporting, and AI search readiness.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="section-label">Ready to improve local visibility?</p>
        <h2>Let’s make your Bend business easier to find.</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you need local SEO help, a website SEO audit, better service pages,
          or a clearer search strategy, I can help you figure out what to focus on next.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="primary-btn">Contact Me About Bend SEO</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
